silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_10_trace_leg_concrete_anchor a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "TraceLegConcreteAnchorExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_10_trace_leg_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'TraceLegConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, AuditTrail_77: the W3C PROV-O audit log for VetRecord_77; records all creation, modification, and access events for VetRecord_77 at Tartu Animal Clinic; append-only; distinct from VetRecord_77 and from SHACLPassReport_77; also, TraceArrow_Audit: the typed arrow AuditTrail_77 -> MittensColimitApex; distinct from record_leg (VetRecord_77 -> MittensColimitApex) and validation_leg (SHACLPassReport_77 -> MittensColimitApex); also, PROV_O_Activity: the W3C PROV-O activity type; AuditTrail_77 entries are typed as PROV-O activities; the provenance ontology authority for audit trail entries." .
